      ":question/worked-solution": "Here, we have the product of the two functions $u(x)=7^{x}$ and $v(x)=\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(u(x)v(x))' &=u'(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot v'(x) \\\\ &=(7^{x})'\\cdot (\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}) \\\\ &\\quad +(7^{x})\\cdot (\\sin{\\left(x \\right)})' \\\\ &=(7^{x} \\ln{\\left(7 \\right)})(\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}) \\\\ &\\quad +(7^{x})(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}) \\\\ &=7^{x} \\ln{\\left(7 \\right)} \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\\\ &\\quad +(7^{x} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)})\\end{aligned}\n$$",
