      ":question/problem": "Differentiate $x\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}$.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Here, we have the product of the two functions $u(x)=x$ and $v(x)=\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(u(x)v(x))' &=u'(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot v'(x) \\\\ &=(x)'\\cdot (\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}) \\\\ &\\quad +(x)\\cdot (\\cos{\\left(x \\right)})' \\\\ &=(1)(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}) \\\\ &\\quad +(x)(- \\sin{\\left(x \\right)}) \\\\ &=\\cos{\\left(x \\right)} \\\\ &\\quad +(- x \\sin{\\left(x \\right)})\\end{aligned}\n$$",
